{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01454","headline":"相和歌辞 采莲曲 · 张籍","name":"相和歌辞 采莲曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋江岸边莲子多，采莲女儿凭船歌。\n青房圆实齐戢戢，争前竞折荡漾波。\n试牵绿茎下寻藕，断处丝多刺伤手。\n白练束腰袖半卷，不插玉钗妆梳浅。\n船中未满度前洲，借问谁家家住远。\n归时共待暮潮上，自弄芙蓉还荡桨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}